sequenceDiagram
  actor Reader
  participant API as ReservationController
  participant Auth as JWT/RBAC
  participant Svc as ReservationService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Reader->>API: POST /api/reservations {titleId}
  API->>Auth: Verify JWT and Reader role
  alt Invalid token / wrong role
    Auth-->>Reader: 401 / 403
  else Authorized
    API->>Svc: placeReservation(readerId, titleId)
    Svc->>DB: BEGIN SERIALIZABLE; lock Reader and Title rows
    Svc->>DB: Check active, zero Available, limit, overdue, duplicate title
    alt Eligibility violation
      DB-->>Svc: Disallowed
      Svc-->>Reader: 422 {error:{code,message}} (ROLLBACK)
    else Eligible
      Svc->>DB: INSERT Pending reservation, FIFO by createdAt and id
      Svc->>DB: COMMIT
      Svc-->>Reader: 201 {reservation,queuePosition}
    end
  end